Name Easter Note - Terevaka #2


Interactability_Text_Line_0 Log: 26/6/18 - Terevaka Bunker: 
Interactability_Text_Line_1 ------
Interactability_Text_Line_2 A magnitude 6.8 tremor just happened, and the facility has received major damage. The whole place feels like it’s heating up. All personnel have been ordered to evacuate. They told us it was safe, they told us it was safe… 